; The public facade (R6.2): effect4.ml and effect4.mli are GENERATED by `make gen-lcnf`
; (OCaml5.Lcnf.Public, from the public roots of ocaml/gen/roots.json and the manifest
; ocaml/gen/public-names.tsv). A client writes Effect4.Program.Eff.t and
; Effect4.Run.Tree.of_program; each path aliases Api_gen or Eff_types with a type equality, and a
; sealed package stays abstract through it. Additive: Api_gen keeps its own names.
; `-open Effect4_gen` lets the generated text name Api_gen as the staged producer compiles it.
; scripts/check-public-facade.py builds a project outside ocaml/ against the installed library.
(library
 (name effect4)
 (public_name effect4_gen.effect4)
 (flags (:standard -open Effect4_gen))
 (libraries effect4_gen effect4_eff))
